[343.232755, "o", "> "]
[343.232857, "o", "- Added `useMemo` to both components to cache calculated statistics\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[343.232967, "o", "- Statistics only recalculate when products array changes\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[343.233042, "o", "## Performance Improvements\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[343.233124, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[343.233155, "o", "### Before:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[343.233339, "o", "- Large bundle size due to lodash (~70KB) and mathjs (~500KB+)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[343.2335, "o", "- O(n*m) review count calculation on every render\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[343.233573, "o", "- Sequential API calls causing 3x delay\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[343.233633, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[343.233747, "o", "- Unnecessary component re-renders\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[343.233869, "o", "- Blocking analytics calls\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[343.233939, "o", "### After:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[343.234059, "o", "- Minimal bundle size with native JS implementations\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[343.234127, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[343.234234, "o", "- O(1) review count lookups with memoized Map\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[343.234351, "o", "- Parallel API calls (3x faster)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[343.234456, "o", "- Memoized components preventing unnecessary renders\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[343.234524, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> - Non-blocking analytics\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[343.234628, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[343.234711, "o", "## Key Patterns Used\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[343.234882, "o", "1. **React.memo()** - Prevent unnecessary component re-renders\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[343.234957, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[343.235047, "o", "2. **useMemo()** - Cache expensive calculations\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[343.235153, "o", "3. **useCallback()** - Stable function references\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[343.23524, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[343.235315, "o", "4. **Promise.all()** - Parallel async operations\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[343.235397, "o", "> "]
[343.235519, "o", "5. **Native JavaScript** - Tree-shakeable, zero-dependency code\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[343.235589, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[343.2357, "o", "6. **Data structure optimization** - Map for O(1) lookups vs array filtering\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[343.235838, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[343.235905, "o", "## Preserved Functionality\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[343.236, "o", "✅ Homepage shows product data\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
