[368.640376, "o", "cat PERFORMANCE_OPTIMIZATIONS.md\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[368.64134, "o", "# Performance Optimizations Summary\r\n\r\n## Issues Identified and Fixed\r\n\r\n### 1. Bundle Size Reduction (Compare Page)\r\n**Problem**: The compare page imported entire `lodash` and `mathjs` libraries, adding hundreds of KB to the bundle.\r\n\r\n**Solution**: \r\n- Replaced all lodash functions (`groupBy`, `sortBy`, `meanBy`, `sumBy`, `maxBy`, `minBy`) with native JavaScript implementations\r\n- Replaced all mathjs functions (`mean`, `std`, `median`, `quantileSeq`, `variance`) with native JavaScript implementations\r\n- Reduced bundle size significantly (compare page now ~89 KB First Load JS)\r\n\r\n### 2. Excessive Re-rendering (ProductList)\r\n**Problem**: \r\n- `getReviewCount()` was called for every product on every render, filtering through all reviews repeatedly (O(n*m) complexity)\r\n- `filteredProducts` was recalculated on every render without memoization\r\n\r\n**Solution**:\r\n- Created a memoized `reviewCountMap` using `useMemo` that builds a Map once when reviews change\r\n- Memoized `filteredProducts` calculation with `useMemo` based on dependencies (products, filter, sortBy)\r\n- Wrapped callbacks with `useCallback` to prevent unnecessary re-renders\r\n- Changed `getReviewCount` from O(n) per product to O(1) lookup\r\n\r\n### 3. Component Re-rendering (ProductCard)\r\n**Problem**: ProductCard components were re-rendering unnecessarily when parent state changed.\r\n\r\n**Solution**:\r\n- Wrapped ProductCard with `React.memo()` to prevent re-renders when props haven't changed\r\n- Combined with memoized callbacks from ProductList for optimal performance\r\n\r\n### 4. Sequential API Calls (Homepage)\r\n**Problem**: Homepage was making 3 sequential API calls (user, products, reviews), causing slow page loads.\r\n\r\n**Solution**:\r\n- Changed to parallel execution using `Promise.all([...])`\r\n- Reduced total API call time from sum of all calls to the longest single call\r\n\r\n### 5. Blocking Analytics (Products API Route)\r\n**Problem**: The products API route was waiting for analytics logging before responding.\r\n\r\n**Solution**:\r\n- Made analytics logging fire-and-forget (non-blocking)\r\n- Parallelize user and products fetch with `Promise.all`\r\n- API responds immediately without waiting for analytics\r\n\r\n### 6. Missing Memoization (Compare Page Components)\r\n**Problem**: ComparisonTable and AdvancedAnalysis were recalculating statistics on every render.\r\n\r\n**Solution**:\r\n- Added `useMemo` to both components to cache calculated statistics\r\n- Statistics only recalculate when products array changes\r\n\r\n## Performance Improvements\r\n\r\n### Before:\r\n- Large bundle size due to lodash (~70KB) and mathjs (~500KB+)\r\n- O(n*m) review count calculation on every render\r\n- Sequential API calls causing 3x delay\r\n- Unnecessary component re-renders\r\n- Blocking analytics calls\r\n\r\n### After:\r\n- Minimal bundle size with native JS implementations\r\n- O(1) review count lookups with memoized Map\r\n- Parallel API calls (3x faster)\r\n- Memoized components preventing unnecessary renders\r\n- Non-blocking analytics\r\n\r\n## Key Patterns Used\r\n\r\n1. **React.memo()** - Prevent unnecessary component re-renders\r\n2. **useMemo()** - Cache expensive calculations\r\n3. **useCallback()** - Stable function references\r\n4. **Promise.all()** - Parallel async operations\r\n5. **Native JavaScript** - Tree-shakeable, zero-dependency code\r\n6. **Data structure optimization** - Map for O(1) lookups vs array filtering\r\n\r\n## Preserved Functionality\r\n\r\n✅ Homepage shows product data\r\n✅ Adding products to cart works\r\n✅ Compare page advanced tab renders properly with `data-testid=\"advanced-content\"`\r\n✅ All `data-testid` attributes preserved\r\n✅ `performance.mark()` calls in ProductCard preserved\r\n"]
[368.641933, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[368.642086, "o", "root@8ba3e6847568:/app# "]
